    "chunk_text": "He bi\u00f0 brice to \u00f0am uferan d\u00e6le \u00fe\u00e6s lichaman. Eft do hyne adune & onlut. He bi\u00f0 behefe to \u00f0am neo\u00f0ran d\u00e6le \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman. \u00c6r\u00f0on \u00feu \u00feysne \u00e6ppel nime, cwe\u00f0 \u00feonne \u00feas word, Aps aps aps sparare rose prospasam emorragiam \u00deonne \u00feu \u00feas word gecweden h\u00e6bbe genim \u00feone \u00e6ppel & hine \u00feonne bewind on weolcreadum \u00deonne nead\u00feearf sy & se ufera d\u00e6l \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman on \u00e6nigum sare o\u00f0\u00f0e on earfe\u00feum geswince, wri\u00f0 on Gyf hyt sy on \u00feam neo\u00f0ran d\u00e6le, wri\u00f0 on \u00fea wambe. Wi\u00f0 wifes flewsan, genim \u00feone camb \u00fee heo ana hyre heafod mid cemde, & n\u00e6nig man \u00e6r mid cemde Under \u00f0am treowe morbeame cembe \u00fe\u00e6r hyre feax, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6r on \u00feam cambe ge\u00feolige, gesomnige, & Eft gif heo wylle \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0\u00e6t hyre blodryne cyme to, cembe eft hyre heafod under morbeame, & \u00fe\u00e6t feax \u00de\u00e6t hyre by\u00fe l\u00e6cedom. Gyf \u00f0u wylle \u00fe\u00e6t wif sy gecl\u00e6nsod \u00fee n\u00e6fre mihte clene beon, wyrc hyre sealfe of \u00feam feaxe, & hit \u00deonne by\u00fe heo gecl\u00e6nsod. Wi\u00fe n\u00e6dran slite, heortes horn hafa\u00f0 m\u00e6gen \u00e6lcne w\u00e6tan to adrigenne; for \u00feam his man bruce\u00fe on Wi\u00fe heafodsare, heortes hornes axan fif penega gew\u00e6ge drinc, nim anne sester wines & twegen \u00dees drenc eac wambesar geha\u00feera\u00f0.",
